        <task Manual_1 (Withdraw the Product from warehouse)/>
        <task Manual_2 (Register in stock management system)/>
        <task Manual_3 (Check if the whole order is ready for shipment)/>
        <task Manual_4 (Packing the products)/>
        <task Manual_5 (Shipping the order)/>
        <task Manual_6 (Courier is requested)/>
        <startNoneEvent StartNoneEvent_1 (Storage management)/>
        <endNoneEvent EndNoneEvent_1 (Order was shipped)/>
        <exclusivegatewayGateway ExclusiveGateway_1 (Is in stock?)/>
        <exclusivegatewayGateway ExclusiveGateway_2 (Arrived after more than ten days?)/>
